# Telegraph Narrows' cable room (CIPlay telegraph_narrows_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: kit_uw mouth on the strait floor at 9 100 (floor flattened to -8 m), the tunnel climbing 12 degrees
# south (7 pieces, size 0.7: floor +1.513 m per 7.12 m of z), the floor passes the sea level near z 62, the den 50.6 -> 28.3 with
# the air zone tn_cable at 9 39.5 and the chest tncablechest at 10.2 38. Floors are guesses (-8 at the mouth, ~+2.6 in the den).
# Swim heights are metres over the sea; walks follow the floor (below=: start under that height).
island Telegraph Narrows keep
offset 0.35 5.1
hour 11
weather Calm
empty

# The strait's north end from the air above the mouth
picture tn_cable_out 9 +6 118 9 -2 100

# Walk in along the flooded tunnel floor from the mouth and up its dry end to the room (as Effigy Shoals' undercroft;
# 11-13 box run: the floor climbs faster than guessed and a walk from above started on the land over the room)
walk 9 99 to 9 92 to 9 84 to 9 76 to 9 68 to 9 60 to 9 52 to 9 46 to 9 41 below=-6
air tn_cable here
picture tn_cable_in 9 4.8 47 9 3.2 36 light=20
open Cable clerks' box
wait 2
expect item Rope 2

# Out again the way in: down the room and the tunnel floor, then swim out of the mouth
walk 9 41 to 9 48 to 9 56 to 9 64 to 9 72 to 9 80 to 9 88 to 9 96 below=4.5
swim 9 99 -6.5 to 9 104 -6 to 9 112 -3
